  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Launch of Solar TVET Curriculum and Trainer Programme in Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity supported the launch of a new national solar energy curriculum for technical and vocational education in Nigeria, developed by Include (Leiden University), the National Board for Technical Education and the Dutch government.A launch event organised by the Netherlands consulate-general in Lagos brought together key government and education stakeholders to support its implementation.In addition, a two-day train the trainer programme for TVET institutions increased participants&apos; knowledge and confidence in teaching solar technologies, helping address capacity gaps and support the growth of Nigeria&apos;s renewable energy sector.</narrative>
  </description>
